Package: cdmeta
Type: Package
Title: Confidence-Distribution-Based Inference for Random-Effects Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.1-0
Date: 2026-07-10
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hisashi", "Noma", email = "noma@ism.ac.jp", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Guido", "Schwarzer", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Hisashi Noma <noma@ism.ac.jp>
Description: Computational tools for confidence-distribution-propagation-based inference in random-effects meta-analysis. The package implements frequentist prediction intervals for the effect in a future study by propagating uncertainty in the between-study variance through the confidence distribution. It also provides interval estimation for the overall mean effect, between-study variance, between-study standard deviation, and heterogeneity proportion. The implemented methods are described in Noma and Schwarzer (2026).
